# Kingdom Keys - save point
# Just the flat circle: the raised rim and the floating gem that came with the moogle
# projector model are gone.
#
# This is the model's top face, which is the one carrying the artwork, dropped to the height
# of the old bottom cap so it sits on the floor instead of hovering above it. The bottom cap
# itself was no use here - it faces downwards and maps to a plain untextured patch.
mtllib savepoint.mtl
o Circle
